PIANO FOR SALE—SQUARE; GOOD TONE;
strings in perfect order; price 500. Can Al.
80 Market St. in the dept.

CHICAGO, Jan. 20.—The news of the day was
really exciting, and as a result the wheat
market was nervous one during most of the
session, with numerous fluctuations within mar-
row limits, but finally decidedly weak feeling
took possession of the pit and prices were
on a firm and quiet.


Gas moderately active,


prices strong and fairly nervous at a slight
decline in price.


Flour firm and unchanged.


