NEW YORK, Jan. 8.—Flour receipts slightly
active; sales 27,750 barrels. Wheat, re-
ceipts 6,000 bushels; exports 1,900 bushels;
sales 9,000 bushels of futures and 1,900 bush-
els on spot; spot market unsettled and quiet.
No. 2 red 9 1/4; No. 2 red spring 9 1/2;
